cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ChronoGrid Reference Implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation (TypeScript/Node.js/PostgreSQL) of ChronoGrid,
  a formal, domain-aware time addressing standard (CGTA) for heterogeneous
  computer systems. Implements the normative stack CG-STD-0000 through
  CG-STD-6100.
authors:
